<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy — Casa Serena" description="How Casa Serena collects, uses, and protects your personal information." heading="Privacy Policy">
  <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>When you enquire about a stay or make a reservation, we collect:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Name and contact details (email, phone number)</li>
    <li>Travel dates and guest preferences</li>
    <li>Payment information (processed securely via our payment provider)</li>
    <li>Communications you send to us</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We also collect anonymous usage data through Vercel Analytics to improve our website experience. No personally identifiable information is stored through analytics.</p>

  <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your enquiry and confirm reservations</li>
    <li>To personalise your stay (dietary requirements, room preferences)</li>
    <li>To communicate important information about your booking</li>
    <li>To improve our services and website</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal data. We share information only with:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Our payment processor for secure transaction handling</li>
    <li>Transfer and excursion partners (name and arrival time only, as needed)</li>
    <li>Legal authorities when required by Greek or EU law</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
  <p>We retain your personal data for the duration of your relationship with us and for up to 5 years after your last stay, in accordance with Greek tax and hospitality regulations. You may request deletion at any time.</p>

  <h2>5. Your Rights (GDPR)</h2>
  <p>As a data subject under EU law, you have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Access your personal data</li>
    <li>Rectify inaccurate information</li>
    <li>Request erasure ("right to be forgotten")</li>
    <li>Restrict or object to processing</li>
    <li>Data portability</li>
    <li>Lodge a complaint with the Hellenic Data Protection Authority</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our website uses only essential cookies and privacy-respecting analytics (Vercel Web Analytics). We do not use advertising cookies or third-party trackers.</p>

  <h2>7. Security</h2>
  <p>All data is transmitted over HTTPS. Payment data is handled by PCI-DSS compliant processors and never stored on our servers.</p>

  <h2>8. Contact</h2>
  <p>Casa Serena Estate<br />Oia, Santorini 847 02, Greece<br /><a href="mailto:privacy@casaserena.com">privacy@casaserena.com</a></p>
</LegalLayout>
